La documentación (README, capítulo 11) dice que sin
org_kde_kwin_appmenu_manager el menú sigue existiendo en D-Bus, pero el
runner solo lo registraba con el protocolo. Lo nota CurseTerm (BK-018).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F89v1xFeQ2WCVD25PBsobh
---
 crates/barrier-kit/src/platform/window.rs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/crates/barrier-kit/src/platform/window.rs b/crates/barrier-kit/src/platform/window.rs
index 3857c73..484b5db 100644
--- a/crates/barrier-kit/src/platform/window.rs
+++ b/crates/barrier-kit/src/platform/window.rs
@@ -423,8 +423,8 @@ impl Runtime {
                         .push((surface_id.clone(), address));
                     wake.ping();
                 });
-                crate::app_menu::server::register(handle.clone());
             }
+            crate::app_menu::server::register(handle.clone());
             menu_handle = Some(handle);
         }
 
